 optimize your operational flow with All Service Rental global support matrix.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"__variable_7fd790 __variable_6b03d3 __variable_a11773 __variable_cd006a __variable_c22fe1 __variable_472ac2 __variable_c70c06 __className_7fd790 antialiased overflow-x-hidden bg-[#001C2F]\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions text\" aria-atomic=\"false\"></section><nav class=\"h-[70px] flex items-center fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 bg-transparent\"><div class=\"container mx-auto w-full px-4 flex justify-between items-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center\"><a href=\"/\"><img alt=\"All Service Rental\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/icons/logo1.svg\"/></a></div><div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-9\"><a class=\"text-white hover:text-secondary font-medium transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/equipment\">Equipment</a><a class=\"text-white hover:text-secondary font-medium transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/how-it-works\">How it Works</a><a class=\"text-white hover:text-secondary font-medium transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a><a class=\"text-white hover:text-secondary font-medium transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\"><a href=\"/login\"><button class=\"bg-secondary hover:bg-secondary/90 text-white font-bold py-2.5 px-8 rounded-[10px] text-sm transition-all active:scale-95 shadow-lg\">Login</button></a><a class=\"text-white hover:text-secondary font-bold text-sm transition-colors\" href=\"/welcome\">Sign Up</a></div></div><div class=\"lg:hidden\"><button class=\"text-white p-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"flex-grow\"><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-black text-slate-200 font-sans selection:bg-[#4ADE80] selection:text-black\"><div class=\"bg-[#011428]\"><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 pt-24 pb-16\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"text-[#4ADE80] text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-6\">Support Infrastructure</p><h1 class=\"text-white text-5xl md:text-7xl font-[900] leading-[0.9] tracking-tight mb-8 support-hero-title\">GLOBAL SUPPORT<br/>MATRIX.</h1><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed font-light mb-10 max-w-xl\">Navigate the kinetic architecture of All Service Rental&#x27;s global logistics network. Resolve protocols, access API endpoints, and optimize your operational flow.</p><div class=\"flex items-center bg-[#24364B] border-solid border-[#3E4A3C] rounded-sm relative support-search-wrapper\"><div class=\"absolute left-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search text-[#4ADE80] w-5 h-5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></div><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"QUERY PROTOCOLS (E.G. &#x27;API ENCRYPTION&#x27;)\" class=\"bg-transparent text-gray-300 text-xs tracking-wider outline-none w-full placeholder:text-gray-500 uppercase\"/></div></div></section></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 pb-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 p-6 rounded-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer group \"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wrench text-[#66DF75] w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-slate-600 font-bold text-xl\">01</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-[18px] md:text-[20px] group-hover:text-[#66DF75] transition-colors\">Rental Process</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] leading-relaxed\">Fleet deployment protocols and hardware lifecycle management.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 p-6 rounded-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer group \"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wallet text-[#66DF75] w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-slate-600 font-bold text-xl\">02</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-[18px] md:text-[20px] group-hover:text-[#66DF75] transition-colors\">Billing &amp; Protocol</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] leading-relaxed\">Financial reconciliation and automated smart-contract auditing.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 p-6 rounded-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer group \"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check text-[#66DF75] w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-slate-600 font-bold text-xl\">03</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-[18px] md:text-[20px] group-hover:text-[#66DF75] transition-colors\">Security</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] leading-relaxed\">Data sovereignty, biometric validation, and neural encryption.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 p-6 rounded-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer group \"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-square-terminal text-[#66DF75] w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7 11 2-2-2-2\"></path><path d=\"M11 13h4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect></svg><span class=\"text-slate-600 font-bold text-xl\">04</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-[18px] md:text-[20px] group-hover:text-[#66DF75] transition-colors\">API Integration</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] leading-relaxed\">Webhooks, RESTful endpoints, and real-time telemetry streaming.</p></div></div></div><section class=\"bg-[#011428] border-y border-slate-800/50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-20 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16\"><div class=\"lg:w-1/3\"><h2 class=\"text-white text-3xl font-black leading-tight mb-4\">ACTIVE QUERY<br/>RESOLUTION</h2><div class=\"w-8 h-1 bg-[#4ADE80] mb-6\"></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-10\">Our kinetic support system operates on a zero-latency protocol. Select a category to filter technical documentation or browse the global matrix.</p><div class=\"space-y-4\"><button class=\"flex items-center text-[#4ADE80] text-xs font-bold tracking-widest hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download w-4 h-4 mr-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg>Download Documentation</button><button class=\"flex items-center text-[#4ADE80] text-xs font-bold tracking-widest hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity w-4 h-4 mr-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg>Live Node Status</button></div></div><div class=\"lg:w-2/3 flex flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-all bg-[#16283d] border-l-2 border-transparent\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-6 md:p-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-[#4ADE80]\">01</span><span class=\"text-white text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase\">HOW DO I AUTHORIZE A COLD-CHAIN FLEET DEPLOYMENT?</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus text-slate-500 w-4 h-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-all bg-[#16283d] border-l-2 border-[#4ADE80]\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-6 md:p-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-[#4ADE80]\">02</span><span class=\"text-white text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase\">ENCRYPTION PROTOCOLS FOR CROSS-BORDER TELEMETRY?</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus text-slate-400 w-4 h-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"px-6 pb-6 pt-2 ml-10\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-700/50 pt-4\">All Service Rental utilizes AES-256 neural-grade encryption for all telemetry data streams. For cross-border transit, we deploy the &quot;Sentinel&quot; protocol which ensures data sovereignty while maintaining real-time latency under 15ms.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-all bg-[#16283d] border-l-2 border-transparent\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-6 md:p-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-[#4ADE80]\">03</span><span class=\"text-white text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase\">AUTOMATED SMART-CONTRACT DISPUTE RESOLUTION?</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus text-slate-500 w-4 h-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-all bg-[#16283d] border-l-2 border-transparent\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-6 md:p-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-[#4ADE80]\">04</span><span class=\"text-white text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase\">API RATE LIMITS FOR HIGH-FREQUENCY TRADING?</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus text-slate-500 w-4 h-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-black py-24 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1A2634] to-[#0F1722] p-16 rounded-sm text-center border border-slate-800/80\"><h2 class=\"text-white text-3xl font-black tracking-tight mb-4 uppercase\">Still Need Assistance?</h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-lg mx-auto\">Our Command Center technicians are available for manual override and direct operational support 24/7/365.</p><button class=\"bg-[#4ADE80] text-black px-8 py-3 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase hover:bg-white transition-colors rounded-sm shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(74,222,128,0.2)]\">Initiate Comms</button></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"w-full pt-20 pb-10 bg-[#021522] font-outfit border-t border-[#021928]\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-2\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 mb-20\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col items-center md:items-start